{"title":"Grumm the Hill King","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Grumm the Hill King is a named <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-king\">Hill Giant King</a> seen at level 30.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Grumm the Hill King</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>Grumm&#39;s Hollow</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 5×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-253\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"grumm-the-hill-king\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>What it can drop</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b2488c3b878505e36b9e.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/grumms-knuckle-warmace\"><b>Grumm&#39;s Knuckle</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Gold Warmace)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">+4% damage for each hit in a row on the same target, up to +20%.</span></li>\n      <li><b>Gear every kill:</b> a piece from its tier, excellent or better, and a second piece 1 kill in 5.</li>\n      <li><b>Gold</b> worth about 5 ordinary kills.</li>\n      <li><b>Enchanted:</b> 1 kill in 100 enchants a piece (up to 9c, and only what its material can hold).</li>\n      <li><b>Elite:</b> a boss spawns elite 1 time in 100, and an elite makes its unique 5 times as likely.</li></ul>\n      <p class=\"muted\">From the game’s rules and its own guide. See <a href=\"#/guide/unique-items\">Unique items</a>.</p>\n      <h2>Drops players have recorded</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">9 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-shield\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a011baeea0e0c4dcdb3b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Shield</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"grumms-knuckle-warmace\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b2488c3b878505e36b9e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Grumms Knuckle Warmace</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/2d79090579fad662adeb.svg\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Grumm the Hill King</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-king\">Hill Giant King</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>30</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>354</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>11 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}